Package: bughunter
Type: Package
Title: Bug Tracer for R Error Handling
Version: 1.0
Date: 2023-11-18
Author: Jiefei Wang
Maintainer: Jiefei Wang <jiefei@example.com>
Description: A package to capture and store call stacks, deparsed code for each frame, and line numbers when errors occur in R, allowing users to trace what happened.
